# Every discoverable area of The Hinterlands, Searing Gorge, Burning Steppes,
# Deadwind Pass, Blasted Lands, Western Plaguelands, Eastern Plaguelands (79 map
# overlays), for both factions. Each `explore` point is the centre of the area's
# map overlay hit rect in the Forever client's tables (WorldMapOverlay,
# UiMapXMapArt, UiMap, AreaTable via wago.tools, build 1.60.1.70338), in the
# map's live frame (written `live` where Forever moved the map or added it, else
# the Era frame it equals); area levels are AreaTable.ExplorationLevel; flight
# masters come from data/forever/travel.json. Zone order and travel lines are
# tools/lib/exploration/spec.js; inside a zone the areas are a shortest tour
# from where you arrive towards the next zone.

step The Hinterlands (1/2)
  zone The Hinterlands
  tip Starts in the Hinterlands, north-east of Hillsbrad Foothills. The last area of this guide completes the Eastern Kingdoms map. 14 areas to discover here, levels 41-49.
  note "Exploring the entire world map on one character is a Forever Legacy Challenge (1 account-wide Legacy Point)."
  note "Fly to Aerie Peak if you have it; otherwise fly to Southshore and walk north-east from Hillsbrad Foothills into the Hinterlands." only Alliance
  note "Fly to Revantusk Village if you have it; otherwise fly to Tarren Mill and walk east from Hillsbrad Foothills into the Hinterlands." only Horde
  note "Flight path here: Aerie Peak (Guthrum Thunderfist)." only Alliance
  note "Flight path here: Revantusk Village (Gorkas)." only Horde
